# Build context for Dockerfile.web is the directory holding all three repos.
# Without this, Docker uploads every node_modules in it — ~275 MB and minutes
# of "transferring context" on every single build.
#
# BuildKit looks for <dockerfile>.dockerignore before the context root's
# .dockerignore, which is why this lives here and stays version-controlled
# (the directory above Backend/ is not a repo).

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/logs
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.vite
**/.DS_Store

# The web image needs only the two portals and the Caddyfile
Backend/**
!Backend/deploy/Caddyfile
